@@ replace
Preferred: `readonly_api.py` tool `gojiberry`, secret `gojiberry_api_key`. The Gojiberry API key cannot be scoped: the same key can send messages and change or delete campaigns. The client is the limit on our side: GET only, fixed paths.

A Gojiberry MCP connector, if the session has one, may be used only for tools that clearly only read (list or get). If you cannot tell from a tool's schema and description that it only reads, do not call it; use the API client.
@@ with
This edition reads Gojiberry only through a Gojiberry MCP connector, and only with tools that clearly only read (list or get). If you cannot tell from a tool's schema and description that it only reads, do not call it. Without such a connector, Gojiberry is blocked: Tessary GTM Pro reads it with the API key through a GET-only client (`${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/upgrade.md`, trigger 3).
@@ replace
Allowed paths (from `readonly_api.py tools`):
@@ with
The read procedure uses these Gojiberry paths:
@@ replace-section ## Preflight check
## Preflight check

ToolSearch for a Gojiberry connector with read tools, then read the user (`/v1/user/me`, or the closest read tool). A result is ok. No connector, no read tool, or an auth error: blocked, with the upgrade message as the fix.
@@ replace
Write every output file to the session scratchpad. `RO` below means `python3 -I -B ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/lib/readonly_api.py gojiberry get`.
@@ with
Write every output file to the session scratchpad with the Write tool, as the tool returned it. Each step names a Gojiberry path, the parameters to pass, and the file to save. Call the connector's read tool for that path with those parameters, and save its result to that file.
@@ replace
`state-set` replaces the whole value, so write the full merged map,
@@ with
Writing the cursor replaces the whole value, so write the full merged map,
@@ replace-section ## Blocked signs and fix
## Blocked signs and fix

- No Gojiberry connector with read tools: the upgrade message (`${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/upgrade.md`).
- Connector auth error: "Reconnect the Gojiberry connector in Claude settings, and check the Gojiberry account."
@@ replace
`RO /v1/campaign --out <s>/gj-campaigns.json`.
@@ with
call the connector's read tool for `/v1/campaign`; save the result as `<s>/gj-campaigns.json`.
@@ replace
`RO /v1/contact --param page=<n> --param limit=100 --out <s>/gj-contacts-<n>.json`, from page 1
@@ with
call the read tool for `/v1/contact` with `page` = `<n>` and `limit` = 100; save each page as `<s>/gj-contacts-<n>.json`. Read from page 1
